cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LaserPerception, cite LaserPerception v0.3.0 and, where reproducibility matters, the
  exact commit used.
type: software
title: LaserPerception
version: 0.3.0
authors:
  - given-names: Mahad
    family-names: Azher
    alias: muhammadmahadazher
repository-code: https://github.com/muhammadmahadazher/laserperception
url: https://github.com/muhammadmahadazher/laserperception
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An open-source 3D LiDAR object-detection and deployment-engineering toolkit built around a
  pretrained PointPillars detector on nuScenes, TensorRT FP16 deployment, exact deterministic
  deployment voxelization, ROS 2, and time-aware raw PointCloud2 multi-sweep ingestion.
keywords:
  - LiDAR
  - point cloud
  - 3D object detection
  - PointPillars
  - nuScenes
  - TensorRT
  - ROS 2
